<title>USA: Applied Materials begins Opal offer.</title>
<headline>Applied Materials begins Opal offer.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Materials Inc said its Orion Corp subsidiary commenced a tender offer for Opal Inc, at $18.50 a share.</p>
<p>The offer is being made under the previously announced merger agreement between Applied Materials and Opal. It is conditioned on a majority of the shares on a fully diluted basis being tendered. The offer expires at midnight December 24.</p>
</text>
